        },
        {
          "text": " Nuko bakinezerewe haza abanyamudugudu b'ibigoryi bagota inzu impande zose, bakomanga ku rugi bavugana n'uwo musaza nyir'urugo bati “Sohora uwo mugabo winjiye mu wawe, kugira ngo tumumenye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo mugabo nyir'urugo arasohoka arababwira ati “Reka bene data ndabinginze, mwe gukora icyaha gisa gityo! Ubwo uyu mugabo yinjiye mu nzu yanjye, mwe kugira ubupfu bungana butyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dore nguyu umukobwa wanjye w'inkumi n'umugore w'uyu mugabo, abo ni bo nsohora namwe mubonone, mubagire uko mushaka, ariko uyu mugabo mwe kumugirira iby'isoni nke bene ibyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko abo bagabo banga kumwumvira. Nuko uwo mushyitsi afata umugore we aramubazanira, baramumenya, baramwonona bakesha ijoro, umuseke utambitse baramurekura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko mu museke, uwo mugore aragaruka agwa ku muryango w'inzu y'uwo musaza, aho shebuja yari acumbitse, burinda bucya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko shebuja abyuka mu gitondo akingura urugi rw'inzu, arasohoka ngo agende. Nuko asanga uwo mugore acuze umurambo ku muryango, intoki ze ziri mu irebe ry'umuryango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aramubwira ati “Haguruka tugende”, ariko ntiyakoma. Aherako aramuterura amushyira ku ndogobe ye. Nuko uwo mugabo aherako arataha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
