              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ageze iwe ashyira intumbi y'umugore we mu nzu, yenda icyuma, amucagagura ingingo zose mo ibice cumi na bibiri, abyohereza mu bihugu bya Isirayeli byose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ababibonye bose baravuga bati “Ibintu bimeze bitya ntabwo byigeze gukorwa cyangwa kuboneka, uhereye umunsi Abisirayeli baviriye muri Egiputa kugeza ubu. Nuko nimubitekereze mubigire inama, mubivuge.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.30"
            ]
          }
        }
